{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":0,"common":true,"examples":[{"en":"He defied me to dive off the cliff.","ja":"彼は私に崖から飛び降りれるものなら飛び降りてみろと言った。","ref":"297585_106101","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"His son fell over the cliff.","ja":"彼の息子は崖から落ちた。","ref":"287054_116614","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Climbing the cliff alone is a bold deed.","ja":"単独でその崖を登るのは大胆な行為だ。","ref":"276695_127425","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The search party found him lying at the foot of a cliff.","ja":"捜索隊は彼が崖の下で倒れているのを発見した。","ref":"273986_140587","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"They would have been killed if the car had gone over the cliff.","ja":"車ががけから落ちていたなら彼らは死んでいただろう。","ref":"265411_149147","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["崖","厓"],"glosses":["cliff","precipice","brink of a dangerous situation"],"id":"1204380","lemma":"崖","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ガケ","readings":["がけ","ガケ"]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"examples":[{"en":"The boat sailed around the promontory.","ja":"船は岬に沿って回った。","ref":"273479_141093","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Cape Dezhnev is 30 miles south of the Arctic Circle.","ja":"デジネフ岬は北極圏の南３０マイルにある。","ref":"39465_202253","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The ship sailed around the cape.","ja":"その船は岬を回った。","ref":"45665_208407","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"There a cape pushes out into the sea.","ja":"そこでは岬が海に突き出している。","ref":"51017_213730","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["崎","岬","埼","碕","﨑"],"glosses":["small peninsula","cape","promontory","headland"],"id":"1297220","lemma":"崎","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"サキ","readings":["さき"]},{"accent":3,"common":false,"etymology":["源自下二段活用動詞崇(あが)む (agamu)。"],"examples":[{"en":"He is worshiped as a god by everyone.","ja":"彼は皆から神のようにあがめられている。","ref":"294695_108995","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["崇める"],"glosses":["to revere","to respect","to worship"],"id":"1372840","lemma":"崇める","pos":["v1","vt"],"readingKata":"アガメル","readings":["あがめる"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/崇める#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/崇/崇め/崇