ships money to exclusion of everything else.","ja":"彼は他のものが目に入らないほどお金を崇拝している。","ref":"301051_102644","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He regarded her with worship in his eyes.","ja":"彼は崇拝の眼で彼女を眺めた。","ref":"300222_103471","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"It is money that many people worship most.","ja":"多くの人が最も崇拝するものはお金である。","ref":"274887_138348","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I admire her truly.","ja":"私は彼女を心から崇拝している。","ref":"261365_153179","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The Romans worshiped their goddess, Juno.","ja":"ローマ人は彼らの女神であるジューノを崇拝した。","ref":"29399_192236","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["崇拝"],"glosses":["worship","adoration","admiration","cult"],"id":"1372870","lemma":"崇拝","pos":["n","vs","vt"],"readingKata":"スウハイ","readings":["すうはい"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/崇拝#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/崇/崇拝/崇拝.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["崇拜。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["崇拜。"],"pos":"n"}]},{"accent":2,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"Drink brought about his downfall.","ja":"酒で彼は身を崩した。","ref":"266104_148454","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"I was ill for weeks after.","ja":"私はその後何週間も体調をくずしていました。","ref":"254334_160187","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Can you change a five-dollar bill?","ja":"五ドル札を崩せますか。","ref":"240029_174440","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Can you break a 10,000 yen bill?","ja":"一万円札、崩してくれますか。","ref":"27200_190044","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Can you break this thousand-yen bill?","ja":"この千円札をくずしてくれませんか。","ref":"58160_220838","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["崩す"],"glosses":["to destroy","to demolish","to pull down","to tear down","to level","to disturb","to put into disorder","to throw off balance","to make shaky","to relax (one's pose)","to make oneself at ease","to break (a bill)","to change","to make change","to write in cursive style","to write in running style","to break into a smile","to let off a smile","to lower (a price)"],"id":"1516260","lemma":"崩す","pos":["v5s","vt"],"readingKata":"クズス","rea